  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2><strong>About our brand and products</strong></h2><p>We are a <strong>science-led animal health brand</strong> focused on <strong>gut health, inflammation management, and performance nutrition</strong> for pets and animals.</p><p>Our products are developed with a <strong>nutrition-first, formulation-driven approach</strong>, designed to support long-term health — not short-term fixes. We work closely with professionals, breeders, and educators who value <strong>quality, evidence, and trust</strong>.</p><p>Our range is positioned as <strong>premium</strong>, education-led, and results-focused.</p><hr><h2><strong>What makes us different</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Formulation-first</strong>: Our products are built around functional ingredients, not marketing trends</p></li><li><p><strong>Education-led</strong>: We prioritise understanding <em>why</em> a product works, not just what it claims</p></li><li><p><strong>Brand integrity</strong>: We do not discount aggressively or compete on price</p></li><li><p><strong>Long-term focus</strong>: We build trust with customers who come back — not one-off buyers</p></li></ul><p>We partner best with affiliates who <strong>care about outcomes, not hype</strong>.</p><hr><h2><strong>How affiliates can earn</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Base commission:</strong> <strong>12.5%</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Performance-based increases</strong> available for high-quality, education-led partners</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive creator codes</strong> may be issued to approved partners</p></li><li><p><strong>Commission + trust</strong>, not just traffic</p></li></ul><p>Higher commissions and customer discounts are <strong>earned over time</strong>, based on content quality, alignment, and performance.</p><hr><h2><strong>How to promote us</strong></h2><p>We encourage affiliates to promote through:</p><ul><li><p>Educational content</p></li><li><p>Honest product experiences</p></li><li><p>Problem–solution storytelling</p></li><li><p>Long-form posts, short-form video, or community engagement</p></li></ul><p>We are <strong>not</strong> a fit for:</p><ul><li><p>Coupon or cashback sites</p></li><li><p>Deal forums</p></li><li><p>Trademark bidding</p></li><li><p>“Discount-first” promotion styles</p></li></ul><p>Your voice matters — authenticity is more important than reach.</p><hr><h2><strong>Other information</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Manual approval only</p></li><li><p>No coupon or deal-only affiliates</p></li><li><p>No discount stacking</p></li><li><p>No paid search using our brand terms</p></li><li><p>Partners who align with our values may be invited into <strong>higher commission tiers</strong> and long-term collaborations</p></li></ul><p>We’re building a brand — not a promo engine.</p></div>",
